          "label": "전압 증폭기 모델",
          "html": "<figure class=\"figure\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 160\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"(a)의 전압 증폭기 모델. 왼쪽 입력 단자 v in에서 R in이 접지로 내려가고 값은 무한대예요. 오른쪽에는 아래가 접지인 종속 전압원 A0 v in이 있고, 위 단자에서 직렬 저항 R out을 지나 맨 오른쪽 출력 단자 v out으로 이어져요.\">\n          <g fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n            <path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M30 50H80V62\"/>\n            <path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M80 62v10l8 4l-16 8l16 8l-16 8l16 8l-16 8l8 4v10\"/>\n            <path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M80 130V136M70 136H90M74 141H86M78 146H82\"/>\n            <polygon class=\"fig-ink\" points=\"280,80 296,100 280,120 264,100\"/>\n            <path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M280 120V136M270 136H290M274 141H286M278 146H282\"/>\n            <path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M280 80V50H310\"/>\n            <path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M310 50h10l4 -8l8 16l8 -16l8 16l8 -16l8 16l4 -8h10\"/>\n            <path class=\"fig-ink\" d=\"M378 50H430\"/>\n          </g>\n          <circle class=\"fig-dot\" data-node-id=\"p10a-vin\" data-node-color=\"blue\" cx=\"30\" cy=\"50\" r=\"4\"/>\n          <circle class=\"fig-dot\" data-node-id=\"p10a-vout\" data-node-color=\"red\" cx=\"430\" cy=\"50\" r=\"4\"/>\n          <g font-family=\"Pretendard, sans-serif\" font-weight=\"600\" font-size=\"14\">\n            <text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" data-node-id=\"p10a-vin\" data-node-color=\"blue\" x=\"30\" y=\"32\" text-anchor=\"middle\">v<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">in</tspan></text>\n            <text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"96\" y=\"102\">R<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">in</tspan> = ∞</text>\n            <text class=\"fig-text\" x=\"280\" y=\"97\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">+</text>\n            <text class=\"fig-text\" x=\"280\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\">−</text>\n            <text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"344\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\">R<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">out</tspan> ≈ 1/g<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">m2</tspan></text>\n            <text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" data-node-id=\"p10a-vout\" data-node-color=\"red\" x=\"430\" y=\"32\" text-anchor=\"middle\">v<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">out</tspan></text>\n            <text class=\"fig-text fig-math\" x=\"256\" y=\"105\" text-anchor=\"end\">A<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">0</tspan>v<tspan baseline-shift=\"sub\" font-size=\"78%\">in</tspan></text>\n          </g>\n        </svg>\n        <figcaption>(a) 전압 증폭기. 입력은 개방이고 출력은 테브난 전압원과 직렬 저항이에요.</figcaption>\n      </figure>"
